title: "MockAgents"
abstract: >-
  A mock server and test toolkit that impersonates the OpenAI, Anthropic,
  Gemini, Ollama, Bedrock, MCP, A2A and Realtime APIs from declarative YAML
  agents, for deterministic, offline testing of AI agent integrations.
